    "title": "Ground truth for DCASE2025Task4EvaluationDataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16736216",
    "publication_date": "2025-08-05",
    "description": "<div>This dataset provides the ground truth data for the DCASE2025Task4EvaluationDataset. It contains the ground truth separation sounds for the target sound events in the 2290 mixtures of evaluation set.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>This dataset is intended to be used in conjunction with the following datasets and the script:</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Training and validation data: <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15117227\">DCASE2025Task4Dataset: The Dataset for Spatial Semantic Segmentation of Sound Scenes</a></li>\n<li>Evaluation data:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15553984\">DCASE2025Task4EvaluationDataset : The Evaluation Dataset for Spatial Semantic Segmentation of Sound Scenes</a></li>\n<li>Script for evaluation:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/nttrd-cslabs/dcase2025_SpatialSemanticSegmentation_evaluator\">nttrd-cslabs/dcase2025_SpatialSemanticSegmentation_evaluator</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Other resources:</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Description page of DCASE2025 task4:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://dcase.community/challenge2025/task-spatial-semantic-segmentation-of-sound-scenes\">Spatial Semantic Segmentation of Sound Scenes - DCASE</a></li>\n<li>Baseline System Github page: <a href=\"https://github.com/nttcslab/dcase2025_task4_baseline\">nttcslab/dcase2025_task4_baseline</a></li>\n<li>arXiv paper describing this dataset: <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.10676\">[2506.10676] Description and Discussion on DCASE 2025 Challenge Task 4: Spatial Semantic Segmentation of Sound Scenes</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
